# 让 git 自己判断文本，二进制显式声明，避免 diff / 换行噪声
* text=auto

*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary

*.ps1 text
*.cmd text
*.cs text
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.json text
*.md text

# 检查更新清单与其签名：签名按字节算，任何换行转换都会让用户端验签失败
updates/*.json -text
updates/*.sig  -text
